          "input_json": "{\u0022path\u0022: \u0022log.md\u0022, \u0022content\u0022: \u0022## [2025-04-10] query | created single-composition-point synthesis\\n\\nCreated [[concepts/single-composition-point]], connecting [[credential-scoping]] and [[runtime-paths]], in response to the query: \\\u0022How do our credential-scoping decisions relate to the runtime-path decisions?\\\u0022 The synthesis identifies that both patterns consolidate their respective decisions at a single Hub startup entry point, preventing downstream components from rediscovering or re-implementing the same logic.\\n\u0022}"
